# Default Size `md` Rule

- For components that expose a `size` prop (or equivalent), default to **`md`** when implementing or updating UI.
- Do not pick `sm` or `lg` unless the design or product requirements explicitly call for a different size.
- When adding stories or examples, use **`md`** as the baseline unless the story is meant to demonstrate another size.
